        "en": [
          "From 12th to 16th July 2021\nFrom 19th to 22nd July 2021\n\nFrom 8 to 15 years old\n90€ per week, registration by phone or on site\n\nFerdi Petit Stadium, avenue Sanguet."
        ],
        "it": [
          "Dal 12 al 16 luglio 2021\nDal 19 al 22 luglio 2021\n\nDa 8 a 15 anni\n90? a settimana, iscrizione telefonica o in loco\n\nStadio Ferdi Petit, viale Sanguet."
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Du 12 au 16 juillet 2021\nDu 19 au 22 juillet 2021\n\nDe 8 à 15 ans\n90€ la semaine, inscriptions par téléphone ou sur place. \n\nStade Ferdi Petit, avenue Sanguet."
        ],
        "nl": [
